{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indie, platform jumping, ultra-short RPG. Come and uncover the mystery behind the protagonist's background together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Game Features]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting and thrilling gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story full of mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A black home page, monochromatic grass, monochromatic characters, text-based tutorials laid out directly, drifting characters, a character that automatically looks to the right, areas almost entirely represented by text alone, a castle you can enter without any guidance, a monochromatic interior of the castle, a second level where you don\u2019t know where to go, lights that don\u2019t change between morning and night, a health bar that isn\u2019t centered, a young hero in the story who shouldn\u2019t be able to fly but does, a chase scene with no sense of urgency, misaligned dialogue boxes, characters that haven\u2019t changed in twenty years\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Development Team]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developer: Budai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art (TBD): Jeannie Cheung</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music: Sara Garrard</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470280?t=1740459817","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470280?t=1740459817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470280/ebff0523615d18d1af8f650ba48371a18a0dc50a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740459817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470280/ebff0523615d18d1af8f650ba48371a18a0dc50a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740459817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descri